\[
\max \Bigg\{ 
\sum_{i \in I} \left[ b_i x_i - f^{\text{item}}_i y_i \right]
+ \sum_{(i,j) \in B} b_{ij} w_{ij}
- \sum_{c \in C} f^{\text{cat}}_c z_c
\Bigg\}
\]

**Constraints:**

